      "title": "Dismiss a system signal",
    },
    "description": "Only the Operator, not in a guest conversation; needs no owner request. Close a ready_waiting system signal of your wake-up that needs nothing, instead of bringing it to the owners: every card it names waits on purpose (for example no priority and outside the focus, parked, or waiting for a person). Give the reason in note. It does not come back until another card becomes ready. A signal you already presented is the owners' to decide (operator_signal_closed).",
    "inputSchema": {
